      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[

### New

- A welcome window on first launch moves the app to Applications, signs your Mac in and turns on opening at login. You can also turn on a notification for when a job fails on your Mac (off by default).
- Quitting while a job runs asks first. You can quit once the job is done, quit now, or cancel.

Includes the relayrunner CLI 0.13.2.
]]></description>
